### Real-Time Network Intrusion Detection System (NIDS): Comprehensive Project Implementation Guide
*Group 16 Capstone Implementation Guide under FUSE AI-201 Module 5 Framework*
#### 1. Executive Summary & Problem Framing
Modern Security Operations Centers (SOCs) face alert fatigue caused by legacy rule-based Intrusion Detection Systems (IDS) with >90% false positive rates. Group 16's capstone formulates network intrusion detection as a 5-class machine learning classification problem using the NSL-KDD benchmark dataset (41 features).
The 5 operational categories are:
1.  **Normal Traffic**
2.  **Denial of Service (DoS)**
3.  **Surveillance / Probing**
4.  **Remote-to-Local (R2L)**
5.  **User-to-Root (U2R)**
